1
00:00:00,581 --> 00:00:01,851
(Penny:)We can do better
than this.

2
00:00:01,849 --> 00:00:02,849
Uh, th-that's true.

3
00:00:02,850 --> 00:00:04,680
(Leonard:)How late did we stay up
last night?

4
00:00:04,685 --> 00:00:07,385
Almost 1:00 a.m.

5
00:00:07,388 --> 00:00:10,558
Damn straight, almost 1:00 a.m.

6
00:00:12,459 --> 00:00:13,789
(Leonard:)And we weren't even watching TV.

7
00:00:13,794 --> 00:00:17,064
(Leonard:)We were watching Netflix,
like the kids do.

8
00:00:17,064 --> 00:00:18,394
(Penny:)Yeah, is it a comedy?

9
00:00:18,399 --> 00:00:19,729
(Penny:)Is it a drama?

10
00:00:19,734 --> 00:00:21,234
(Penny:)Nobody knows.

11
00:00:21,235 --> 00:00:23,105
(Penny:)Now, come on.

12
00:00:23,104 --> 00:00:24,804
(Penny:)We are gonna do this.
Yeah.

13
00:00:24,805 --> 00:00:26,675
(Leonard:)You get the paint,
I'll rest for 30-40 minutes,

14
00:00:26,674 --> 00:00:28,744
and then we do this!

15
00:00:30,043 --> 00:00:32,383
(Sheldon:)I can't believe you
almost had me bring

16
00:00:32,380 --> 00:00:35,710
(Sheldon:)a wild animal
into my home.

17
00:00:35,716 --> 00:00:38,316
(Amy:)No one told you to poke
the turtle's face.

18
00:00:39,286 --> 00:00:43,026
(Sheldon:)I was playing
"Got Your Nose."

19
00:00:43,024 --> 00:00:44,924
(Sheldon:)That's how you get
children to like you.

20
00:00:46,993 --> 00:00:49,033
(Amy:)I'm surprised you even care
if he likes you,

21
00:00:49,030 --> 00:00:50,530
(Amy:)since you're planning
on leaving the planet

22
00:00:50,531 --> 00:00:52,131
(Amy:)the first chance you get.

23
00:00:52,133 --> 00:00:53,633
(Sheldon:)Ugh, this again.

24
00:00:53,634 --> 00:00:56,634
(Sheldon:)Amy, I've already had one new
hole torn in my body today.

25
00:00:56,637 --> 00:00:58,967
(Sheldon:)I don't need another one.

26
00:00:58,973 --> 00:01:01,303
(Amy:)Sheldon, I know the odds

